    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it does feel like the only way to actually have control over anything left. everyone talks about \"fighting it,\" but fighting it just means more months or years of being a burden and watching my mind rot. if i wait, i won't even be the one making the decision. i'll just be a body being looked after. isn't there some kind of dignity in deciding when the story ends, rather than letting it just fade into nothingness?",
